display_name="T6 Front Panel"
desc="Front touch-screen app for the UnifyDrive UP6 / ZSpace T6: dashboard, screen and network info, device settings. Requires T6 Control Center."
changelog="1.3.0: a built-in video and music player (open a video or song in Files): hardware-decoded up to 4K HDR, touch controls, screen rotation, subtitles and a choice of audio output. Sound goes through PipeWire (installed automatically; installing is refused while PulseAudio is present): Settings → Audio picks the output and volume, and the admin page shows the sound server with an output choice and a Repair button. Settings → Bluetooth pairs headphones, speakers, keyboards, remotes and game controllers (keyboards show a pairing code) alongside the Bluetooth app; audio switches to a Bluetooth speaker when it connects. 1.2.0: Settings → Indicator lights has the full LED settings of the Control Center (bays, status LEDs, tray light, night mode with its daily window); brightness goes down to 1 %. 1.0.3: the screen timeout now runs in the backend and watches the touchscreen itself, so the screen still turns off if the panel app hangs or restarts; screen off no longer sleeps the panel (phantom touches, no double-tap wake). 1.0.2: panel sleep/wake with safe backlight ordering; display errors are reported without illuminating an uncertain panel; corrected kiosk start/stop sequencing."

